15	 * inline "create category" validation branches.
16	 *
17	 * The component imports the Supabase singleton and ExpenseService at module scope
18	 * (both only used for vendor-rule loading, which is gated on merchantName+familyId).
19	 * We mock those boundaries so a bare render stays pure; no test here passes a
